<table height="400" width="550" cellpadding="5" border="0" cellspacing="5" >
<tr height="400" valign="top" >
<td style=" color:#000000; font-size:12pt; background-color:#FFFFFF; font-family:arial; bLabel:main; bEditID:r3st1;" tEditID="c1r1" locked="0" aEditID="c1r1" >
<![CDATA[<div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial">Hello&nbsp;{!Contact.FirstName}</font><span style="font-family: arial;">,</span></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><span style="font-family: arial;"><br></span></div><div><div><font face="arial">Thank you for expressing interest in Arizona State University. We have added you to our mailing list, but you will find that most of our communication is done through email.</font></div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><font face="arial">We do not mail out any catalogs or view books – just another one of our sustainability practices. However, I’m sure you will find our website very helpful.&nbsp;</font></div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><font face="arial">First, I encourage you to explore this <a href="http://www.asu.edu/myfuture/index-desktop.html">interactive site</a> about ASU. It includes videos, student experiences and answers to some most commonly asked questions. You can also find more specific information about <a href="https://webapp4.asu.edu/programs/t5/undergrad">degree programs</a> and <a href="https://students.asu.edu/freshman/requirements">admission criteria</a> online.&nbsp;</font></div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><font face="arial">Please let me know how I can further assist you in your college search.</font></div></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><div><font face="arial">{!User.Recruiter_Full_Name__c}</font></div><div><font face="arial">{!User.Recruiter_Title__c}</font></div><div><font face="arial">Admission Services</font></div><div><font face="arial">{!User.Recruiter_Email__c}</font></div><div><font face="arial">{!User.Recruiter_Phone__c}</font></div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><div style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: medium;"><font face="arial" size="2" color="#666666">If you have any additional information or questions related to this, please reply to this email.</font></div><div style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: medium;"><font face="arial" size="2" color="#666666"><br></font></div><div style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: medium;"><font face="arial" size="2" color="#666666">{!Case.Thread_Id}</font></div></div></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></div>]]></td>
</tr>
</table>